  "2026-10-19T17:58:34.087Z",codex-agent,"2026-10-19 documentation-only capacity candidate reproduces the native command snapshot failure in npm run release:check with explicit read-only canonical fleet metadata. Current source adds context, deps, docs, files, history, search and test beyond the eight committed snapshot commands. The full suite reports 668/673 passing and five catalog/fleet freshness failures, zero cancelled/skipped/todo. No snapshot or source changes are included. Evidence: docs/capacity/2026-10-19-ladder.md; pm-web-h4vh."
